{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "9cbdae90c18e5fd3668166b894f852fdb46599d13531cf99949b93824ca82863", "ja": "鳴 ～Arrive～", "zh": "鸣 ～Arrive～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fdbfdfb2919af059a82953873033a8f48fce8311306d4347e1c4ed3847ccb330", "ja": "静香は星梨花と共に外出していた。「何がそ\r\nんなに、楽しみなんだ？」ジュリアの言葉が\r\n胸に刺さったまま……そこに志保が現れ、叱\r\n咤激励する。静香が顔を上げたとき、スマホ\r\nに千早からのメッセージが届いた。", "zh": "静香和星梨花一起外出。“到底有什么那么值得期待的？”茱莉亚的话一直刺在她心头……这时志保出现，对她进行了鼓励与鞭策。静香抬起头时，手机收到了千早发来的消息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "7e5d3c6666a36e3572ea0e929e0e50d9eb51ead52f2257c20d08a2fad234b809", "ja": "静香さん、わたし、ジュースを買えました！\n携帯を当てるだけで買えるなんて、すごいです♪", "zh": "静香，我买到果汁了！\n只要把手机碰一下就能买到，真厉害♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "1fcf0f0583c8b297c6c30aebd081f844e2268c18d86594fec50c64da7a140cc6", "ja": "静香さん……。\nあ、コップ……どうしようかな……。", "zh": "静香……。\n啊，杯子……该怎么办呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "2b6fdee6a04783e93317bf93c17a0f38229b7ddf43c92fae2e9ad4bd35017a91", "ja": "……？　あっ、ありがとう星梨花！\nごめんなさい、気を使わせちゃって。", "zh": "……？啊，谢谢你，星梨花！\n对不起，让你费心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "d4bef7cf1fe5b037ec1704b37ea36a2fbb1aac6989eba2efcffc7d5447ae527c", "ja": "あ……いいえ、気にしないでください。\nわたしが勝手について来てるだけです。", "zh": "啊……不用在意。\n只是我自己擅自跟过来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "b391234033e14bb6d14eea8355ac3e27e13b2df94b54e2e5733e5f8cb93308a2", "ja": "あの……。あっ、ケーキ食べますか？\n劇場の冷蔵庫に入ってるよって、美咲さんが……。", "zh": "那个……啊，要吃蛋糕吗？美咲小姐说蛋糕放在剧场的冰箱里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "df1fa0d92598dd23b7079c7d898d9d0f0c581b3282f96330e353ddf9eed324d8", "ja": "うん……あとで帰ったらね。\n今は、私……。なんか……ダメだなって。", "zh": "嗯……等回去之后再说吧。\n我现在，总觉得自己……好像……很没用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "bc7454d89a9171ca12687316f5fbe7c149832f5d1aed9f530d5801f4271a9f57", "ja": "静香さん……。", "zh": "静香……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "0b3fe4abcb0071d5201ef0f6ea2b1b93ff094b7a9339d8c1b945563fa04412e8", "ja": "ジュリアさんのいう通り……。\n楽しみって……。何が……？", "zh": "正如茱莉亚先生所说……\n所谓期待……究竟是什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "e6ad9924c9ad61bc1628b5a7fe32f017159827d153faa74adab0449326f18235", "ja": "私、何を楽しみにしてたんだろう。\n何を舞い上がってたんだろう？", "zh": "我，到底在期待什么呢。\n到底在兴奋什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "23a014248570bec79efa67dd2e99dc2e3ca6c67b8b3c709b464681ca53e040fe", "ja": "千早さんに、歌いたいって言ってもらえたからって。\nただ、それだけなのに……バカみたい。", "zh": "只是因为千早小姐对我说了想唱歌。我却那么期待，还兴奋得不得了……真像个傻瓜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "469871ce9a6ef4c2568089ad2768f491c0933c6a62ea6dbc341ac8cdccb5350b", "ja": "そんなこと……。", "zh": "才不是那种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "bb2360be76a2de1e75410b341ec25c4801ad198fcfe37d5b4ef5e8693fed681e", "ja": "千早さんは、最初から先を見ていたのにね。\nどう歌うか、どうするか、ちゃんと考えていたのに。", "zh": "千早小姐明明从一开始就着眼于未来。\n明明认真考虑过该怎么唱、该怎么做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "05daf2ac42bdd609a950b090f7a0c4d202cf892bc1703a0d798ed18dbacfa216", "ja": "私はただ、喜んで……。\nバカだ。本当にバカ……。", "zh": "我只是，满心欢喜……\n真傻。真的很傻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "451fca988384596184bff753bcd85c147be8821789781f4685c1f6419d2247d1", "ja": "でも……。\n私は、静香さんが好きです。", "zh": "但是……。\n我喜欢静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "27b8b23287f38e14964618346d9b1ade9a4578755533badd968df21ff6921dbe", "ja": "優しくて、きれいで。しっかりしていて、\nときどき……かわいくて。でも、とっても……。", "zh": "温柔又漂亮。做事认真，有时……也很可爱。不过，真的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "3e1262b3932d1df534ec71125c802ab5cbab259bf41d30f6560112d633271823", "ja": "とっても、まっすぐで！", "zh": "特别坦率！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "b49052d4bc9084baa827305be7e38af7e6b9dc0d98f8941dd8454d0b37ebc87f", "ja": "……。星梨花……？", "zh": "……星梨花……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "f6a1e2235d6df6e5c33e0ac181e77266b122e69ea232f26c8fd26a6a0eb7bda2", "ja": "わたし、あの曲を聴いてすぐ思いました。\n静香さんが歌ってくれたらいいな、って。", "zh": "我听了那首歌之后，立刻就想到了。\n要是能由静香小姐来唱就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "3ec6d7a8a01f652d574a516e37e634e117736604084c2db43bbd513f94be5ed4", "ja": "千早さんが歌いたいって言った時も、思いました。\n静香さんが、一緒に歌ってくれないかな、って。", "zh": "千早姐姐说想唱的时候，我也是这么想的。\n要是静香姐姐能和她一起唱就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "6af8e87eb6bc7d703a65a0ed3f96a9a7cfe6a21640eb6962ae94b4d39a775775", "ja": "だから……わたしはやっぱり、今も楽しみです。\nお二人のステージが……、とっても！", "zh": "所以……我现在还是很期待。\n期待两位的舞台……特别特别期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "d64aa0df9542db0bda83fd9087753d4b84834f52d49a319a461a77becf7c0c4e", "ja": "せ……星梨花……。", "zh": "星……星梨花……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "3169ccaa85b99bdafcd54b46ddde91c790b6a0eec7e3bd2239cc834b02f743f0", "ja": "こんなところにいたのね。\nいつまでお喋りしてるつもり？", "zh": "原来你在这里。\n你打算聊到什么时候？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "9256970782928b69899d8c92c9800dafd88c1cd6671836b541f0d9233a8bf35a", "ja": "え……志保？　どうして……。", "zh": "诶……志保？你怎么会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "3b336f7a7bd9db790f0134ea85c1342b626f58d8888d6def2b3d1761cc4bd77d", "ja": "星梨花を呼びに来たの。レッスン、もう始まるわよ。\nそれとも、誰かさんのお世話で忙しいかしら。", "zh": "我是来叫星梨花的。课程马上就要开始了。\n还是说，你正忙着照顾某个人呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "57ac6f8056c91db1723d2be15313a9ebeaa8f0d71cc33eabbdb9717286c5a3a2", "ja": "な……どういう意味！？", "zh": "什……你这话是什么意思！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "94ce69ba533d897a0b980afe51ed920116721d8805e3fd028608ef1d61331161", "ja": "あ、あのっ、違うんです志保さん！\nわたしが勝手についてきただけで……すぐ戻りますっ。", "zh": "啊、那个，不是这样的，志保小姐！\n只是我擅自跟过来的……我马上回去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1029_033sih", "source_sha256": "37ef5c46243ed054d7c66f9fac97d494889edbcfdb7be0821f3a3965ddd53a92", "ja": "その方がいいわね。公演には私たちも出るんだから。\nそれに……。", "zh": "那样比较好。毕竟公演我们也要参加。\n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "0a88bb839cb02a6d843ffdcd2742120cc9563c0164c3ef932ec8ff62eccef36f", "ja": "あの曲。……私も聴かせてもらったけど。\nステキね。……似合いそう。", "zh": "那首歌……我也听过了。\n很棒呢。……感觉挺适合的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "c91b9681e892b6a3ba6c41bd84e363b307b8a939fcff43aad049facc41bd6e09", "ja": "え……。そ、そうよね。\n千早さんに、ピッタリ……。", "zh": "诶……对、对吧。\n很适合千早……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "ba10f00ae79ae6981781e416774ad6ccdd2af3bb309f4df80dbcdc97758f0576", "ja": "……。まあいいわ。だったらなおさら、\nボーッとしてるヒマはないんじゃない。", "zh": "……算了。那样的话就更不能发呆了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "b6a2ec1e91adaa35028fa19dd8400bbb916b70977d8ced9d1e2885435e8c890f", "ja": "わ、わかってるわよ！\nちゃんと……わかってる……。", "zh": "我、我知道啦！\n我真的……知道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "a3a7a534c8073fcd5980641cd4c33bf7adf83de56e6a8d9a83661e21a34715cf", "ja": "そう、よかった。……行きましょう、星梨花。\n静香はもう大丈夫ですって。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。……我们走吧，星梨花。\n静香已经没事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "c4fddadc7e036a8997102d92d097aacf6fd1f13f2d8edae2e09b7a675b1f99d7", "ja": "だから、私たちもしっかりレッスンしないと。\n……頑張りましょう。", "zh": "所以，我们也得好好练习才行。\n……一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "f8dd6ea684d0f7ea8fc3aef775ea0cb97a5a4d57b92a3f1424d6de232b953747", "ja": "はいっ。それじゃ……静香さん、お邪魔しました。\nあの……公演、一緒に頑張りましょうね！", "zh": "好的！那么……静香小姐，打扰了。\n那个……公演时，我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "9e3c89d164665eba4b2993f1f2c4077c53557c3741b3d47ad7227cce33a8badf", "ja": "私……。私は……。", "zh": "我……。我是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1039_null", "source_sha256": "8d672fc290e4f5bb608e77c9c513ae831b878bcdb2a9947dcc94a54988e63289", "ja": "ブーッ！　ブーッ！", "zh": "哔──！哔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "4221e612caf0c74e1d989fed2fe30bd025d43fe79c12af4d384c82e0683aefaa", "ja": "あ、メッセージ……誰だろう。未来はまだ仕事……。\n……えっ！？", "zh": "啊，是消息……会是谁呢。未来还在工作……。\n……诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1041_002chi", "source_sha256": "b30efdedcc5a4f6d4990954006bcfe9b5c62b6a6ae19713f336f7e8c0382b37a", "ja": "『静香。\nレッスン一緒にできなくて、ごめんなさい』", "zh": "『静香。\n没能和你一起练习，对不起』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1042_002chi", "source_sha256": "f04678b32ff8149334124ac6c5ebf4809264d7b7dce190c5fc04184247c4de2d", "ja": "『でも静香に見せたいのは、\nもっと突き詰めてからの私なの』", "zh": "『但我希望展现给静香看的，\n是进一步钻研打磨后的自己』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1043_002chi", "source_sha256": "98ed12cb49a75c99fa487a4c39ff7d3361bd7369abd2ecfc71bd4c015fab8c68", "ja": "『だから、待っていて』", "zh": "『所以，等我吧』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1044_002chi", "source_sha256": "0b24425c3cde1e2019e65bfb92ae7d52b1a59fc86211ff7bc370b2b92f26c1f1", "ja": "『私も、待っているから』", "zh": "『我也会等着的』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1045_015siz", "source_sha256": "f1fcf6e3d29b67bc356a338d771a8ef70ba5e49bbc8b36558059f5f2b5b99283", "ja": "……っ！！", "zh": "……っ！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1046_022ser", "source_sha256": "e77af9b47de5e2a4f538e85812994677e9dbc89ca7c84316ba319941e4bd37d7", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さん、ジュリアさん！", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生、茱莉亚先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1047_033sih", "source_sha256": "906db29068e455dbc8528fdc4772558b397f69d743f7dc11547d642ec4c0c627", "ja": "これでいいですか。", "zh": "这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1048_p", "source_sha256": "8126112c35356ebcc7e7beb10504f1f689ec735d27818f9637c133eb35209033", "ja": "ああ、助かったよ。ありがとう、志保。\n星梨花も、静香をありがとうな。", "zh": "啊，帮大忙了。谢谢你，志保。\n星梨花，也谢谢你陪静香一起过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1049_022ser", "source_sha256": "c3504549fe0c26260d9bf5afa054bc855727630a540dfba6afe884870702216a", "ja": "わたしは、本当に勝手について行っちゃっただけで……\nあ、レッスンごめんなさい！", "zh": "我真的只是自作主张跟过来的……啊，耽误你练习了，对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1050_050jul", "source_sha256": "3f90734bfbfa68d54ac60f9c68b5a99ffe58532a860811a592460351253d793b", "ja": "それはいいんだって。さっきのままじゃ、\nさっぱり身が入らなかっただろうし。", "zh": "那没关系。要是一直保持刚才那样，根本没法专心练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1051_033sih", "source_sha256": "341ca406f83defee4b989ebba701abf8144faa7d6077221234dde7aeb7de717f", "ja": "……私じゃなくて、ジュリアさんが行けば\nよかったんじゃないですか。", "zh": "……明明不是我去，而是茱莉亚先生去\n比较好才对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1052_050jul", "source_sha256": "54e6f7d9141d51af01c778bebe5daa33a26163a4de28f3001fac0a17917b36df", "ja": "いや、なんか思ったより落ち込ませちゃったからさ。\n行かない方がいいかなー、とか？", "zh": "没有，就是感觉比我想象的更打击到你了嘛。\n所以想说……我还是别去比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1053_033sih", "source_sha256": "8fb770e287eab2c3534e0a7ed1e7ebe2177b2a527f538f09636538b9aadb7b69", "ja": "……まあ、いいですけど。\n私も、言いたいこと言えてスッキリしましたし。", "zh": "……算了，也无所谓。\n而且把想说的话说出来之后，我也觉得痛快多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1054_050jul", "source_sha256": "fbf6430c1a3d7bb01eafc39a7c58835ce001a493690b1e2845b35bfd747dcd50", "ja": "へえ～……。なるほど、ね！", "zh": "哦～……原来如此啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1058_p", "source_sha256": "36b5055b3ce74566c92d49907529302bb97bcb16615f2eaafe49206bb1b457e6", "ja": "（アイドルにとって、一番の刺激は……\nやっぱり同じアイドルなんだろう）", "zh": "（对偶像来说，最大的刺激……果然还是同为偶像的人吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_04_1059_p", "source_sha256": "4419a97388ce427ef8cf892c84f13e23d619024756e376998a96cc8cf5c2f808", "ja": "（競い合い、支え合う彼女達の……\n心の揺らぎは、しっかり見守っていかないとな）", "zh": "（她们互相竞争、互相支持……\n她们内心的变化，我可得好好关注才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
